Alice Init
    * get Bob's public prekey
    * generate fresh ratchet key pair
    * get sending chain key

Alice --> Bob

 Bob Init
    * set ratchet key pair to used prekeys

Bob's ratchet keys = prekeys
Alice ratchet keys = fresh
    Therefore, Bob does DH ratchet

Bob DH ratchet
    * generate sending chain key
    * generate receiving chain key
    * generate fresh ratchet keys

Bob --> Alice

 Bob's ratchet keys = fresh
 Alice's ratchet keys = old fresh
    Therefore, Alice does DH ratchet

